  "claim": "This athlete played for a sports team, two years after he was drafted. He was re-acquired in the 2015 sports team's season. Bob Gresham also played for this sport's team.",
  "evidencia": "Page: 2009 New York Jets season. Sentence: The New York Jets were represented at the 2010 Pro Bowl by Darrelle Revis, Nick Mangold, Shaun Ellis, D’Brickashaw Ferguson, and Alan Faneca.\nPage: Darrelle Revis. Sentence: He played college football for the University of Pittsburgh and was drafted in the first round (14th overall) by the New York Jets in the 2007 NFL Draft.\nPage: 2015 New York Jets season. Sentence: Prior to the season, the Jets made a number of moves, including, re-acquiring Darrelle Revis and Antonio Cromartie, two cornerbacks who were instrumental in the Jets previous defensive success, and obtaining Ryan Fitzpatrick and Brandon Marshall in trades.\nPage: Bob Gresham. Sentence: He played for the New Orleans Saints, the Houston Oilers, and the New York Jets.",
