        "original_id": "213103af-7eb5-5694-9714-aabbe1bcea4b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Darrelle Revis, Nick Mangold, Shaun Ellis, D’Brickashaw Ferguson, Alan Faneca, Antonio Cromartie, Ryan Fitzpatrick, Brandon Marshall, Bob Gresham\n- Organizations: New York Jets, University of Pittsburgh, New Orleans Saints, Houston Oilers\n- Events: 2007 NFL Draft, 2010 Pro Bowl, 2009 New York Jets season, 2015 New York Jets season\n\nFacts:\n- Darrelle Revis played college football for the University of Pittsburgh.\n- Darrelle Revis was drafted by the New York Jets in the first round with the 14th overall pick in the 2007 NFL Draft.\n- The New York Jets were represented at the 2010 Pro Bowl by Darrelle Revis, Nick Mangold, Shaun Ellis, D’Brickashaw Ferguson, and Alan Faneca.\n- Before the 2015 New York Jets season, the New York Jets re-acquired Darrelle Revis and Antonio Cromartie.\n- Before the 2015 New York Jets season, the New York Jets obtained Ryan Fitzpatrick and Brandon Marshall in trades.\n- Bob Gresham played for the New Orleans Saints, the Houston Oilers, and the New York Jets.",
